\subsection{Experimental Setup}
\label{sec:setup}

All experiments run on the same machine with the specifications listed
in Table~\ref{tab:setup}. The benchmark host is a shared workstation
under continuous desktop load (WorkBuddy$\times$4, WPS$\times$6, WeChat,
explorer). This load contaminates absolute timing measurements: the
SM2 signature verification median measures 68.2~ms on the loaded host
versus 4.66~ms on a quiet machine (14.6$\times$). Consequently, we
report \emph{quiet-machine values} for all timing-dependent metrics
(E1, E2, E6) and \emph{loaded-host values} only as qualitative
corroboration. Correctness properties (E3, E4, E5, E7) are
load-independent and reported from the loaded host.

